{"abstract":"Large Language Models (LLMs) have seen widespread societal adoption. However, while they are able to interact with users in languages beyond English, they have been shown to lack cultural awareness, providing anglocentric or inappropriate responses for underrepresented language communities. To investigate this gap and disentangle linguistic versus cultural proficiency, we conduct the first cultural evaluation study for the mid-resource language of Danish, in which native speakers prompt different models to solve tasks requiring cultural awareness. Our analysis of the resulting 1,038 interactions from 63 demographically diverse participants highlights open challenges to cultural adaptation: Particularly, how currently employed automatically translated data are insufficient to train or measure cultural adaptation, and how training on native-speaker data can more than double response acceptance rates. We release our study data as DaKultur - the first native Danish cultural awareness dataset.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Müller-Eberstein, Max","Zhang, Mike","Bassignana, Elisa","Brunsgaard Trolle, Peter","van der Goot, Rob"],"cuid":["S02-091.89-813317"],"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Cultural Awareness","Danish language","Large Language Models"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dakultur evaluating the cultural awareness of language models for danish with native speakers","src":["aau","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2025.c3nlp-1.5/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-091.89-813317","ids":["aau-285c9042-fdc3-47f3-b49c-80a84514b36d","itu-39488485-b9dc-4aab-b098-1a00f4ad5114"],"keyword":["Cultural Awareness","DaKultur Dataset","Danish Language","Large Language Models","Native-Speaker Data"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-CC65833422460DE272D3DF96AF29DBBB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2025.c3nlp-1.5/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NLPnorth"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Data, Knowledge and Web Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Max","key":"müllerebersteinpau","last":"Müller-Eberstein","locid":"523ffd96-f3b2-49cc-8f24-dc9215b84bed","name":"Müller-Eberstein, Max","orcid":"0000-0002-0006-0658","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mike","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","locid":"95b88f39-4927-48b0-9415-b2b3d0b43db8","name":"Zhang, Mike","orcid":"0000-0003-1218-5201","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Elisa","key":"bassignanapau","last":"Bassignana","locid":"c6b67626-5ff8-4730-93a6-70ee08f6013e","name":"Bassignana, Elisa","orcid":"0009-0003-8374-7571","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"brunsgaardtrollepau","last":"Brunsgaard Trolle","name":"Brunsgaard Trolle, Peter","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Brunsgaard","key":"trollepau","last":"Trolle","locid":"d21db1f2-9a89-4611-8077-e06e89985faa","name":"Trolle, Peter Brunsgaard","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rob","key":"vandergootpau","last":"van der Goot","locid":"8e5f2a6c-c817-4a90-b48b-d9171743ad0f","name":"van der Goot, Rob","orcid":"0009-0003-1999-4156","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Association for Computational Linguistics","status":"p","title":"3rd Workshop on Cross-Cultural Considerations in NLP (C3NLP)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-285c9042-fdc3-47f3-b49c-80a84514b36d","itu-39488485-b9dc-4aab-b098-1a00f4ad5114"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"DaKultur : Evaluating the Cultural Awareness of Language Models for Danish with Native Speakers","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.89-813317","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Dehumanization is a mental process that enables the exclusion and ill treatment of a group of people. In this paper, we present two data sets of dehumanizing text, a large, automatically collected corpus and a smaller, manually annotated data set. Both data sets include a combination of political discourse and dialogue from movie subtitles. Our methods give us a broad and varied amount of dehumanization data to work with, enabling further exploratory analysis and automatic classification of dehumanization patterns","author_count":3,"contributors":["Trolle, Peter Brunsgaard","Hardmeier, Christian","Engelmann, Paul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-776448"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Automated text classification","Dehumanization","Political discourse"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a dataset for the detection of dehumanizing language","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2402.08764","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-776448","identifier":[{"id":"85185868622","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-c105cfde-646f-401f-a0d8-d78c7c415acb"],"keyword":["Automated text classification","Dehumanization","Movie subtitles","Political discourse","Text corpora"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3E965E2F5944EB048A1A752FE5D52020"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2402.08764","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Brunsgaard","key":"trollepau","last":"Trolle","locid":"d21db1f2-9a89-4611-8077-e06e89985faa","name":"Trolle, Peter Brunsgaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"hardmeierpau","last":"Hardmeier","locid":"9504265d-0046-4e58-b529-256a656c012d","name":"Hardmeier, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-6103-7275","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Paul","key":"engelmannpau","last":"Engelmann","name":"Engelmann, Paul","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-c105cfde-646f-401f-a0d8-d78c7c415acb"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Dataset for the Detection of Dehumanizing Language","type":"Other-Unknown","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-776448","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
